  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "不可变客户端",
      "items": [
        "OkHttpClient 全部字段都是 val，改配置要走 newBuilder() 复制出新实例",
        "共享 ConnectionPool 与 Dispatcher 是复用连接与并发额度的前提，务必只 build 一次"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "责任链",
      "items": [
        "getResponseWithInterceptorChain 固定顺序装配 RetryAndFollowUp → Bridge → Cache → Connect → CallServer",
        "RealInterceptorChain.proceed 用 index 前进一步，每次调用 copy(index+1) 生成新链，实现逐环嵌套"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "连接复用",
      "items": [
        "ExchangeFinder 先查 RealConnectionPool 里的健康连接，未命中才由 ConnectPlan 建 TCP/TLS",
        "RealConnection 用 allocationLimit 控制 HTTP/2 多路复用上限，noNewExchanges 标记后不再接新流"
      ]
    }
  ]
}